  ozelFonksiyon: 
  aciklama:
  - "Telvelerin, ilerleyen haftalarda ya\u015Fayaca\u011F\u0131n bir g\xFCn\xFCn\xFCn,
    son {{sayi,2,10}} y\u0131lda ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n en \u015Fansl\u0131
    g\xFCn\xFCn olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor! O g\xFCn, {{sayi,2,3}} g\xFCzel
    haberi pe\u015F pe\u015Fe alacaks\u0131n {{isim}}. G\xFCne dair baz\u0131 emareler
    de var fincan\u0131nda; {{kelime, havan\u0131n \xE7ok so\u011Fuk olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131,
    ancak hafif kapal\u0131 oldu\u011Fu | havan\u0131n a\xE7\u0131k fakat biraz serin
    oldu\u011Fu | havan\u0131n bas\u0131k, keyifsiz fakat \"\u0131l\u0131k\" oldu\u011Fu
    | havan\u0131n bulutlu ve \u015Fimdiye nazaran biraz daha so\u011Fuk oldu\u011Fu
    | havan\u0131n a\xE7\u0131k ve ferah oldu\u011Fu}} bir g\xFCn olacak. Bug\xFCn
    gibi bir {{gun_0}} ya da {{sayi,3,4}} heceli farkl\u0131 bir g\xFCn olabilir.
    \U0001F9D0Hatta \u015F\xF6yle ileri d\xFCzey bir detay var; ilk m\xFCjdeden sonra
    g\xFCn i\xE7erisinde g\xF6z\xFCne bir yerde {{kelime, George Orwell'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"hayvan \xE7iftli\u011Fi\" | Aldous Huxley'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"cesur
    yeni d\xFCnya\" | Antoine de Saint-Exup\xE9ry'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\xFC\xE7\xFCk
    prens\" | Malcolm Gladwell'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"outliers\" | Lev Tolstoy'un
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"insan ne ile ya\u015Far\" | Paulo Coelho'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"simyac\u0131\" | Marlo Morgan'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bir \xE7ift
    y\xFCrek\" | \u0130hsan Oktay Anar'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"puslu k\u0131talar
    atlas\u0131\" | Sabahattin Ali'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\xFCrk mantolu Madonna\"
    | Grigori Petrov'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"beyaz zambaklar \xFClkesinde\" |
    Jos\xE9 Mauro de Vasconcelos'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\u015Feker portakal\u0131\"
    | Fyodor Dostoyevski'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"yeralt\u0131ndan notlar\" |
    Nancy H. Kleinbaum'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\xF6l\xFC ozanlar derne\u011Fi\"
    | Jos\xE9 Saramago'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\xF6rl\xFCk\" | Stefan Zweig'\u0131n
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"satran\xE7\" | Lev Tolstoy'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"sava\u015F ve bar\u0131\u015F\" | Victor Hugo'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"Notre
    Dame'\u0131n kamburu\" | Victor Hugo'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"sefiller\"
    | Miguel de Cervantes'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"Don Ki\u015Fot\" | Mark Twain'in
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"insan nedir\" | Edgar Allan Poe'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"morgue soka\u011F\u0131 cinayeti\" | Alper Can\u0131g\xFCz'\xFCn yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"kan ve g\xFCl\" | Murat Mente\u015F'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"dubl\xF6r\xFCn
    dilemmas\u0131\" | Fr\xE9d\xE9ric Gros'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"y\xFCr\xFCmenin
    felsefesi\" | Erlom Ahvlediani'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"sivrisinek \u015Fehirde\"
    | \u0130lber Ortayl\u0131'n\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bir \xF6m\xFCr nas\u0131l
    ya\u015Fan\u0131r\" | Daniel Defoe'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"Robinson Cruose\"
    | Ahmet Hamdi Tanp\u0131nar'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"saatleri ayarlama
    enstit\xFCs\xFC\" | Orhan Pamuk'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"babam\u0131n bavulu\"
    | Sabahattin Ali'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"hep gen\xE7 kalaca\u011F\u0131m\"
    | Carl-Johan Vallgren'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bir garip a\u015Fk \xF6yk\xFCs\xFC\"
    | Alice Miller'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"beden asla yalan s\xF6ylemez\"
    | Bernard Malamud'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"tamirci\" | Emily Bront\xEB'nin
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"u\u011Fultulu tepeler\" | Nikolay Vasilyevi\xE7 Gogol'un
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bir delinin hat\u0131ra defteri\" | Ayn Rand'\u0131n
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"hayat\u0131n kayna\u011F\u0131\" | Gabriel Garc\xEDa
    M\xE1rquez'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 pazartesi\" | Virginia
    Woolf'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"kendine ait bir oda\" | Wilhelm Reich'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"dinle k\xFC\xE7\xFCk adam\" | Albert Camus'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"yabanc\u0131\"
    | Harper Lee'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"b\xFClb\xFCl\xFC \xF6ld\xFCrmek\" |
    Zeynep Ka\xE7ar'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"kabuk\" | Ya\u015Far Kemal'in
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"ince memed\" | Hasan Ali Topta\u015F'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"ku\u015Flar yas\u0131na gider\" | Clarissa Pinkola Estes'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"kurtlarla ko\u015Fan kad\u0131nlar\" | Yakup Kadri Karaosmano\u011Flu'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"yaban\" | Peyami Safa'n\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"dokuzuncu hariciye
    ko\u011Fu\u015Fu\" | Anthony Burgess'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"otomatik
    portakal\" | John Steinbeck'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"fareler ve insanlar\"
    | George Orwell'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"1984\" | Ahmet \xDCmit'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"a\u015Fk\u0131m\u0131z eski bir roman\" | O\u011Fuz Atay'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"tutunamayanlar\" | Ray Bradbury'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"fahrenheit 451\"
    | Yusuf At\u0131lgan'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"aylak adam\" | Irvin D.
    Yalom'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"Nietzsche a\u011Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda\"
    | Nurdan G\xFCrbilek'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"vitrinde ya\u015Famak\" | Franz
    Kafka'n\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm\" | Charles Dickens'\u0131n
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"iki \u015Fehrin hikayesi\" | Jane Austen'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"a\u015Fk ve gurur\" | Ernest Hemingway'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"ya\u015Fl\u0131
    adam ve deniz\" | Stefan Zweig'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bilinmeyen bir
    kad\u0131n\u0131n mektubu\" | Oscar Wilde'\u0131n \"mutlu prens\" | Jerome David
    Salinger'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\xE7avdar tarlas\u0131nda \xE7ocuklar\"
    | Chuck Palahniuk'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"d\xF6v\xFC\u015F kul\xFCb\xFC\"
    | Gabriel Garc\xEDa M\xE1rquez'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"y\xFCzy\u0131ll\u0131k
    yaln\u0131zl\u0131k\" | Albert Camus'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"veba\" | Orhan
    Pamuk'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"Cevdet Bey ve o\u011Fullar\u0131\" | Jean Christophe
    Grange'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"son av\" | Stephen King'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"medyum\" | Hakan G\xFCnday'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"az\"}} isimli kitap
    tak\u0131labilir. Ayr\u0131ca o g\xFCn muhtemelen biraz ba\u015F\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131yor
    olacak. G\xFCn sonunda ge\xE7ece\u011Finden eminim. \n\nFincan\u0131n\u0131n
    alt k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda ise a\u011Fz\u0131 t\u0131ka basa dolu bir al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015F
    sepeti var {{isim}}. \U0001F6D2 Uzak bir yere seyahate gitmek ya da hay\u0131rl\u0131
    bir i\u015Fi ger\xE7ekle\u015Ftirmek \xFCzere {{gelecek_ay}} ya da {{ay_2}} ay\u0131n\u0131n
    sonlar\u0131na do\u011Fru haz\u0131rl\u0131k yap\u0131p yola koyulaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    hissediyorum."
